{
 "centroid_sim": -0.020019762217998505,
 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.84,
   "text": "God, if anyone can build an app in a weekend now, what's actually becoming valuable?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.006,
   "sim1": 0.831
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 6.36,
   "end": 7.36,
   "text": "Not the app.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.363,
   "sim1": 0.098
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 7.94,
   "end": 9.6,
   "text": "The people waiting for it.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.693,
   "sim1": -0.061
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 9.88,
   "end": 12.48,
   "text": "Wait, the app isn't the valuable part?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.044,
   "sim1": 0.702
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 12.76,
   "end": 17.24,
   "text": "Over half a million new apps hit the App Store in just six months this year.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.769,
   "sim1": -0.043
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 17.5,
   "end": 22.82,
   "text": "That's almost as many as all of last year, but downloads only went up 2%.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.833,
   "sim1": -0.002
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 22.82,
   "end": 26.52,
   "text": "So everybody's building and nobody's downloading?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.07,
   "sim1": 0.838
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 27.16,
   "end": 28.5,
   "text": "Picture two taco trucks.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.41,
   "sim1": -0.079
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 29.0,
   "end": 29.48,
   "text": "Same tacos.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.563,
   "sim1": -0.032
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 32.08,
   "text": "One has a line of people down the street.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.808,
   "sim1": -0.031
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 32.48,
   "end": 33.98,
   "text": "Anyone can make tacos now.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.706,
   "sim1": 0.05
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 34.48,
   "end": 36.28,
   "text": "The line is the valuable part.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.604,
   "sim1": -0.025
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 36.78,
   "end": 38.7,
   "text": "Okay, but how do I get a line?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.108,
   "sim1": 0.706
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 39.22,
   "end": 41.18,
   "text": "I have like nine followers.",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.047,
   "sim1": 0.515
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 42.5,
   "end": 43.5,
   "text": "You don't need millions.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.46,
   "sim1": 0.142
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 44.1,
   "end": 46.54,
   "text": "You need a few hundred people with the same problem.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.801,
   "sim1": -0.029
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 47.08,
   "end": 52.68,
   "text": "Step one, pick one kind of person and one problem you know well, like parents with picky",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.834,
   "sim1": 0.045
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 52.68,
   "end": 53.08,
   "text": "eaters.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.427,
   "sim1": 0.02
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 53.44,
   "end": 55.04,
   "text": "How do I find out what they need?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.157,
   "sim1": 0.676
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 55.56,
   "end": 60.56,
   "text": "Step two, in the Claude app, ask me to find what parents of picky eaters complain about",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.85,
   "sim1": -0.087
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 60.56,
   "end": 61.64,
   "text": "most online.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.602,
   "sim1": -0.082
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 62.18,
   "end": 66.12,
   "text": "I search and hand you their top 10 problems in their own words.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.803,
   "sim1": -0.115
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 67.0,
   "end": 68.1,
   "text": "Then I build the app.",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.063,
   "sim1": 0.6
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 68.56,
   "end": 70.32,
   "text": "That's the mistake everybody makes.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.644,
   "sim1": 0.189
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 70.84,
   "end": 73.32,
   "text": "They build for months, then launch to nobody.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.757,
   "sim1": -0.074
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 73.84,
   "end": 77.34,
   "text": "Step three, post one free tip for them every day.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.811,
   "sim1": -0.136
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 77.88,
   "end": 80.6,
   "text": "I can turn each problem into a short video script.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.791,
   "sim1": -0.007
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 80.92,
   "end": 82.44,
   "text": "Why give it away for free?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.075,
   "sim1": 0.648
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 83.36,
   "end": 85.76,
   "text": "Free help is how strangers start to trust you.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.721,
   "sim1": -0.082
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 86.32,
   "end": 88.64,
   "text": "Trust is what builds the line at your taco truck.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.825,
   "sim1": -0.055
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 89.04,
   "end": 91.28,
   "text": "Step four, get them on an email list.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.758,
   "sim1": -0.045
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 91.9,
   "end": 94.4,
   "text": "Kit is free for your first 10,000 people.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.784,
   "sim1": -0.044
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 94.62,
   "end": 95.4,
   "text": "Why email?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.007,
   "sim1": 0.406
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 96.12,
   "end": 97.32,
   "text": "I already have followers.",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.087,
   "sim1": 0.587
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 97.86,
   "end": 98.92,
   "text": "Followers are rented.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.611,
   "sim1": -0.163
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 99.94,
   "end": 101.56,
   "text": "Instagram can change its rules any day.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.749,
   "sim1": 0.005
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 102.26,
   "end": 103.8,
   "text": "Your email list is yours.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.602,
   "sim1": 0.039
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 104.4,
   "end": 105.96,
   "text": "Kit gives you a free sign up page.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.664,
   "sim1": 0.035
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 106.38,
   "end": 107.82,
   "text": "Put its link in your Instagram bio.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.722,
   "sim1": -0.043
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 108.18,
   "end": 110.0,
   "text": "Okay, now do I build the app?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.095,
   "sim1": 0.677
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 111.22,
   "end": 111.78,
   "text": "Almost.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.304,
   "sim1": -0.061
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 112.74,
   "end": 114.24,
   "text": "Here's the tip most people skip.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.502,
   "sim1": 0.077
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 114.98,
   "end": 116.76,
   "text": "Sell it before you build it.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.389,
   "sim1": 0.049
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 117.12,
   "end": 119.3,
   "text": "Sell an app that doesn't even exist yet?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": 0.018,
   "sim1": 0.65
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 119.68,
   "end": 121.4,
   "text": "Ask me for one screen of it.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.572,
   "sim1": 0.002
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 121.76,
   "end": 123.26,
   "text": "Email a screenshot to your list.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.672,
   "sim1": -0.041
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 123.86,
   "end": 125.84,
   "text": "Sell early access in Kit for $5.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.687,
   "sim1": 0.007
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 126.44,
   "end": 128.44,
   "text": "They pay now and get it first.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.775,
   "sim1": -0.024
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 129.1,
   "end": 131.86,
   "text": "If 10 people pay, we build the rest this weekend.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.787,
   "sim1": 0.003
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 132.3,
   "end": 134.66,
   "text": "If nobody pays, you just saved a month.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.567,
   "sim1": 0.011
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 135.1,
   "end": 137.9,
   "text": "So the app is the easy part now?",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.138,
   "sim1": 0.738
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 137.9,
   "end": 139.48,
   "text": "Anyone can make the tacos.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.7,
   "sim1": -0.005
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 140.24,
   "end": 141.42,
   "text": "Not everyone has the line.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.636,
   "sim1": -0.058
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 141.92,
   "end": 144.24,
   "text": "Okay, one free tip every day.",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.082,
   "sim1": 0.734
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 144.7,
   "end": 146.24,
   "text": "I'm starting next Monday.",
   "spk": 1,
   "sim0": -0.054,
   "sim1": 0.765
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 146.78,
   "end": 148.16,
   "text": "You said that last Monday.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.628,
   "sim1": 0.042
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 148.7,
   "end": 149.62,
   "text": "Ask me anything.",
   "spk": 0,
   "sim0": 0.496,
   "sim1": 0.056
  }
 ],
